WEBVTT

01:38.480 --> 01:41.640
BASED ON THE NOVEL
"THE PRISONER OF BEAUTY" BY PENGLAI KE

01:46.320 --> 01:48.800
If the Qiao clan hadn't betrayed us,

01:49.440 --> 01:51.680
my father and brothers wouldn't have died,

01:53.160 --> 01:54.320
my mother…

01:57.040 --> 01:59.320
wouldn't have died of grief,

01:59.400 --> 02:00.440
and I

02:01.160 --> 02:03.960
wouldn't have become a wild child
fighting wolves for food.

02:05.320 --> 02:06.160
So,

02:07.000 --> 02:08.280
all members of the Qiao clan

02:09.440 --> 02:10.600
deserve death.

02:29.520 --> 02:30.440
My lord…

02:31.600 --> 02:32.560
Why?

02:34.320 --> 02:35.560
She saved Xindu.

02:50.600 --> 02:52.920
Orders from the Lord of Wei!
Capture Lady Qiao! Kill her for morale.

02:53.000 --> 02:53.920
Yes!

03:02.160 --> 03:03.360
Search every corner!

03:03.760 --> 03:05.840
Capture Lady Qiao! Kill her for morale!

03:05.920 --> 03:06.920
Yes!

03:07.000 --> 03:09.920
Search the city thoroughly!
Kill Lady Qiao for morale!

03:10.000 --> 03:10.960
Understood.

03:28.360 --> 03:29.200
Xiaoqiao.

04:01.480 --> 04:02.520
Xiaoqiao.

04:02.600 --> 04:04.320
Come here, I'll protect you.

04:09.760 --> 04:10.600
Xiaoqiao.

04:11.560 --> 04:13.840
I took refuge with the Qiao clan
at age 13.

04:15.000 --> 04:16.600
When I was 18, I returned to Liangya.

04:18.600 --> 04:20.600
Those five years with the Qiao clan

04:22.040 --> 04:24.200
were the happiest of my life.

04:27.240 --> 04:28.640
My feelings for you

04:28.720 --> 04:30.680
are true and unchanging.

04:33.880 --> 04:34.880
I know

04:36.040 --> 04:37.560
you're full of doubts right now.

04:38.560 --> 04:39.360
Don't be afraid.

04:40.600 --> 04:42.480
I've thought it all through.

04:42.560 --> 04:44.040
Just come with me

04:44.120 --> 04:46.400
and I can pretend none of this happened.

04:50.240 --> 04:51.240
My lord,

04:51.320 --> 04:52.600
won't you say something?

04:55.800 --> 04:56.960
Come here.

04:57.040 --> 04:58.680
It would have been better
if you hadn't spoken.

05:07.480 --> 05:08.640
Manman.

05:15.680 --> 05:17.360
I think of you as a jewel.

05:39.680 --> 05:41.520
You do see me as a jewel.

05:46.680 --> 05:48.920
But you treat everyone else like ants!

05:51.800 --> 05:52.680
Shoot!

06:05.680 --> 06:06.680
Loose arrows!

06:08.680 --> 06:09.560
Stop!

06:10.320 --> 06:11.520
Kill them!

06:11.600 --> 06:12.920
Kill them!

06:13.760 --> 06:15.520
The theft of your wife demands vengeance,

06:15.600 --> 06:16.520
but not today.

06:17.120 --> 06:18.520
Go! Go now!

06:18.600 --> 06:21.000
- Attack!
- Kill them!

06:21.080 --> 06:22.400
Protect Young Master Liu!

06:22.480 --> 06:23.760
Go! Let's go!

06:24.920 --> 06:27.560
- Kill!
- Charge!

07:02.760 --> 07:04.800
Traitor Liu, don't you run!

07:04.880 --> 07:06.280
Xiao, let's capture him.

07:06.720 --> 07:07.520
Charge!

07:09.040 --> 07:11.920
Kill him!

07:21.240 --> 07:22.040
Does it hurt?

07:27.000 --> 07:27.880
Here?

07:32.360 --> 07:33.520
You're being delicate.

07:34.560 --> 07:35.800
Back on the battlefield,

07:36.240 --> 07:37.760
some had their legs broken

07:37.840 --> 07:38.920
or even had their bones exposed.

07:39.000 --> 07:40.720
They just wrapped it up and kept fighting.

07:41.800 --> 07:43.560
Why cry over this scratch?

07:47.680 --> 07:49.440
Yes, it's all my fault.

07:50.080 --> 07:51.680
Blame me, a spoiled girl,

07:51.760 --> 07:56.400
for not being as tough as
the soldiers in your army

07:57.040 --> 07:59.280
who can forge their shattered bones anew,

07:59.360 --> 08:00.840
hardened like steel.

08:00.920 --> 08:02.520
That's why I'm unworthy to be with you.

08:04.240 --> 08:06.440
No need for that tone.

08:15.680 --> 08:17.920
I'm not crying over this wound.

08:18.000 --> 08:19.160
My pain is nothing

08:19.240 --> 08:21.840
compared to the people's suffering.

08:22.320 --> 08:23.200
Then why?

08:25.160 --> 08:28.440
I just never thought
we'd meet again after I left Xindu.

08:31.000 --> 08:34.159
If Wei Xiao's arrow had killed me,

08:34.240 --> 08:37.000
I wouldn't have heard
your kind words just now.

08:37.080 --> 08:38.280
I stopped him, didn't I?

08:38.360 --> 08:40.600
But what about
"kill Lady Qiao for morale"?

08:43.200 --> 08:45.720
You'd rather kill the innocent
than spare the guilty.

08:46.360 --> 08:50.000
You had no proof, yet you still believed
that I'd eloped with Liu Yan.

08:50.080 --> 08:54.120
Meanwhile, I burned the sulfur for you
and even helped you take the city.

08:56.480 --> 08:58.040
You should've stayed out of it.

09:00.120 --> 09:01.400
Matters of war

09:01.480 --> 09:03.360
are no place for a woman to meddle.

09:04.320 --> 09:05.360
You nearly died here.

09:05.440 --> 09:09.440
If my life can buy the lives of
the people, then it's worth it.

09:09.520 --> 09:13.840
The Qiao clan has always protected
the people and the soldiers,

09:14.280 --> 09:15.920
never letting one die in vain.

09:16.000 --> 09:18.360
It has never changed since 14 years ago.

09:24.360 --> 09:25.200
Fine.

09:26.360 --> 09:28.000
It's my fault for meddling.

09:29.000 --> 09:31.720
It's my fault for fighting alone.

09:32.480 --> 09:35.280
When I was kidnapped at Xindu's gate,

09:35.360 --> 09:37.520
it was my fault for being clumsy

09:37.600 --> 09:39.440
and delaying your takeover of Panyi.

09:40.280 --> 09:42.160
Now you're stuck tending to me.

09:42.240 --> 09:42.960
Enough.

09:43.760 --> 09:44.960
No more self-pity.

09:47.840 --> 09:49.400
Get on. I'll carry you back.

09:52.680 --> 09:53.560
How dare I?

09:53.640 --> 09:54.760
Stop talking. Get on.

10:35.120 --> 10:35.920
Hold still.

10:40.720 --> 10:42.040
The current you

10:42.120 --> 10:45.200
is nothing like the one
who drove me out of Xindu.

10:46.840 --> 10:48.600
So let me speak my heart.

10:49.200 --> 10:51.000
I no longer wish to marry anymore.

10:52.360 --> 10:56.240
In the past, Liu Yan looked down on me
because of my meager dowry.

10:56.320 --> 10:58.680
Later, when he learned that
Panyi was part of it,

10:58.760 --> 11:00.080
he tried to force the marriage.

11:00.640 --> 11:01.560
And you?

11:01.960 --> 11:05.160
After taking my seal of Panyi,
you cast me out of Xindu.

11:05.240 --> 11:07.000
How are you any different?

11:07.520 --> 11:10.520
For women in this world,
marriage is a sacred matter.

11:10.600 --> 11:12.560
Why must mine be so fraught with hardship?

11:12.640 --> 11:13.760
Am I unworthy?

11:16.280 --> 11:17.840
I'm telling you, I won't marry.

11:46.680 --> 11:47.840
My lady,

11:47.920 --> 11:50.000
you truly don't wish to marry Wei Shao?

11:51.360 --> 11:52.760
Of course I do.

11:54.200 --> 11:55.960
But he must be the one to act.

11:56.760 --> 12:00.120
Right now, he's already seized Panyi.

12:00.880 --> 12:02.280
What leverage do we have?

12:02.360 --> 12:04.760
In war, the best strategy
is to conquer minds.

12:06.080 --> 12:08.560
I want him to marry me of his own will.

12:10.000 --> 12:11.240
I saw

12:11.320 --> 12:14.280
that when the Lord of Wei
escorted you back earlier,

12:14.360 --> 12:16.080
he seemed quite unsettled.

12:22.080 --> 12:24.600
No wonder Grandfather often said,

12:24.680 --> 12:26.800
"Water overcomes hardness with softness."

12:36.600 --> 12:38.160
QIAO MANSION, YANZHOU

12:38.240 --> 12:39.680
Now,

12:40.360 --> 12:43.920
the only one I still worry about

12:44.760 --> 12:46.800
is Manman.

12:47.720 --> 12:48.880
In the future,

12:49.600 --> 12:53.000
if she ever needs our help,

12:54.120 --> 12:56.920
treat it as

12:58.000 --> 13:00.880
the most urgent matter.

13:00.960 --> 13:02.600
- Understood.
- Understood.

13:06.760 --> 13:08.280
Lord Wei…

13:09.600 --> 13:11.600
Brother Wei…

13:14.840 --> 13:17.680
I failed you.

13:19.600 --> 13:22.000
May my grandchildren…

13:24.240 --> 13:28.080
not fail yours.

13:39.400 --> 13:40.280
Father…

13:40.600 --> 13:41.920
Father.

13:42.000 --> 13:43.080
Father…

13:46.000 --> 13:47.480
Father!

13:51.880 --> 13:53.680
Father!

14:03.120 --> 14:05.680
SPIRIT TABLET OF THE LATE LORD QIAO GUI

14:07.840 --> 14:10.480
Perform the memorial rituals.

14:23.400 --> 14:25.800
Rest in peace, Lord Qiao.

14:25.880 --> 14:26.760
QIAO MANSION

14:26.840 --> 14:28.920
Rest in peace, Lord Qiao.

14:29.000 --> 14:31.680
Rest in peace, Lord Qiao.

14:31.760 --> 14:32.640
Ping,

14:33.800 --> 14:35.120
if in this life,

14:35.560 --> 14:38.520
I can earn people's love like Father did,

14:39.200 --> 14:40.400
I'll have no regrets.

14:43.680 --> 14:46.320
SPIRIT TABLET OF THE LATE LORD QIAO GUI

14:46.400 --> 14:49.680
PANYI, WEI STATE

14:58.880 --> 15:00.400
Listen up, everyone!

15:00.880 --> 15:03.560
By our lord's order,

15:03.640 --> 15:09.040
we're recruiting able-bodied men
to repair the city defenses.

15:09.120 --> 15:11.760
Each worker will get
one peck of grain per day.

15:13.120 --> 15:14.960
Interested? Sign up over there.

15:18.000 --> 15:19.920
My stomach's acting up.

15:20.000 --> 15:21.040
I can't go.

15:22.880 --> 15:25.600
Sir, do you have any sons?

15:27.000 --> 15:29.000
Do you have any sons?

15:29.080 --> 15:30.520
What did you say?

15:30.600 --> 15:32.120
Do you have any sons?

15:33.080 --> 15:34.280
Old man!

15:34.360 --> 15:35.200
Dinner's ready!

15:36.080 --> 15:36.960
Coming!

15:42.760 --> 15:45.120
I told you not to move around.
You never listen!

15:45.200 --> 15:46.920
- Scary.
- Just wait till we get home!

15:49.280 --> 15:51.320
This feels familiar.

15:52.720 --> 15:56.040
Too bad Panyi doesn't have
a second People's Wall

15:56.120 --> 15:57.400
for our lord to knock down.

15:57.480 --> 15:58.600
Enough talk.

15:59.280 --> 16:00.960
Who's handling rations?
Who's taking the census?

16:01.040 --> 16:02.960
- Let's draw straws.
- Draw straws.

16:03.360 --> 16:04.360
Come on.

16:05.600 --> 16:06.520
My turn.

16:06.600 --> 16:07.960
Fine, fine.

16:13.520 --> 16:15.000
My boy, thank you in advance.

16:15.080 --> 16:16.600
You'll get used to it.

16:16.680 --> 16:17.680
Get lost.

16:17.760 --> 16:18.680
Let's go.

16:21.880 --> 16:23.320
What terrible luck.

16:23.400 --> 16:25.040
The people of Panyi know

16:25.120 --> 16:28.800
that Lord Qiao has gifted this place
to his daughter as a dowry.

16:28.880 --> 16:32.920
Now that you hold the seal,
it follows that you must have her trust.

16:33.600 --> 16:37.840
For Panyi's citizens,
serving their ruler is only natural.

16:38.280 --> 16:42.000
It's just that something went wrong.

16:42.080 --> 16:44.720
Young Master Liu
brought Miss Xiaoqiao here instead,

16:44.800 --> 16:46.880
vowing to marry her.

16:47.400 --> 16:48.360
However,

16:48.440 --> 16:51.880
if Miss Xiaoqiao herself announces
the marriage alliance,

16:51.960 --> 16:52.840
just one line,

16:53.960 --> 16:57.680
then with the seal in hand,

16:57.760 --> 16:59.200
you can rightfully claim Panyi.

17:00.000 --> 17:01.640
You're an interesting mayor.

17:02.120 --> 17:04.880
As the saying goes,
"Every land breeds its own kind."

17:05.920 --> 17:07.119
You Yanzhou folk…

17:08.680 --> 17:09.920
are all cunning.

17:11.040 --> 17:12.839
I'm wronged, Lord Wei.

17:12.920 --> 17:14.960
My loyalty is genuine.

17:15.520 --> 17:16.839
Mayor,

17:16.920 --> 17:18.520
you may leave for now.

17:18.599 --> 17:20.920
Then I'll take my leave.

17:25.280 --> 17:28.000
Though Yang Feng is unreasonable,

17:28.079 --> 17:29.960
his words aren't entirely wrong.

17:30.680 --> 17:31.800
I believe

17:31.880 --> 17:33.440
that I can do this without her.

17:33.520 --> 17:35.400
She's just a helpless woman.

17:36.000 --> 17:37.920
Why must you dwell on it, my lord?

17:43.440 --> 17:45.960
Won't you go see her?

17:46.040 --> 17:47.640
Me? See her?

17:48.480 --> 17:49.560
No way.

17:54.200 --> 17:55.280
Xiaotao.

17:59.160 --> 18:00.360
What do you want?

18:00.440 --> 18:01.680
His Lordship sent me

18:01.760 --> 18:03.960
to deliver ointment to Miss Xiaoqiao

18:04.040 --> 18:05.200
and invite her for a talk.

18:05.280 --> 18:06.320
Here.

18:08.760 --> 18:09.760
She won't see him.

18:11.040 --> 18:14.600
His Lordship has urgent matters
to discuss with Miss Xiaoqiao.

18:14.680 --> 18:16.320
What urgent matters?

18:16.400 --> 18:17.560
It's already past noon.

18:17.960 --> 18:19.360
Miss Xiaoqiao is resting.

18:21.120 --> 18:22.480
After all,

18:22.560 --> 18:25.400
she burned her wrist stopping Liu Yan

18:25.840 --> 18:28.400
and saving Wei people.

18:28.480 --> 18:31.200
This water was just used
to clean her wounds.

18:32.480 --> 18:33.560
What?

18:33.640 --> 18:34.800
General Wei Duang,

18:34.880 --> 18:36.360
you wouldn't disturb her, right?

18:37.840 --> 18:39.400
You just can't stop calling me that, huh?

18:39.480 --> 18:40.680
I'm Wei Liang!

18:40.760 --> 18:41.720
We four brothers are

18:41.800 --> 18:43.600
Wei Liang, Wei Qu, Wei Xiao, Wei…

18:43.680 --> 18:45.320
I don't care which "Wei" you are.

18:47.000 --> 18:47.840
Fine.

18:49.200 --> 18:51.320
Miss Xiaoqiao deserves better than you.

18:51.800 --> 18:52.560
I…

18:52.640 --> 18:54.040
I'll return at noon tomorrow.

18:59.480 --> 19:00.680
NEXT DAY

19:00.760 --> 19:03.360
Please let Miss Xiaoqiao know that
our lord requests a meeting.

19:04.720 --> 19:07.080
A meeting or an accusation?

19:08.240 --> 19:10.600
This looks just like Liu Yan's style.

19:11.080 --> 19:12.440
- Step back.
- Yes, sir.

19:16.240 --> 19:17.520
Now may I invite Miss Xiaoqiao?

19:18.480 --> 19:19.560
She's taking a nap.

19:20.240 --> 19:21.480
But it's barely noon.

19:21.560 --> 19:22.920
Did she skip lunch to rest?

19:23.000 --> 19:24.760
Her wounds are causing pain,

19:24.840 --> 19:28.520
so she has no appetite
and went to bed early.

19:29.040 --> 19:30.160
Please, General,

19:30.240 --> 19:31.800
come earlier tomorrow.

19:33.280 --> 19:35.720
THE FOLLOWING DAY

19:39.000 --> 19:40.120
Miss Xiaotao.

19:42.360 --> 19:45.000
I picked fresh goods at the market.
Take a look.

19:47.160 --> 19:49.360
For you, Xiaozao, and Chunniang.

19:49.440 --> 19:50.920
And for Miss Xiaoqiao too.

19:51.480 --> 19:53.400
Would you speak to her today?

19:53.480 --> 19:55.320
Ask her to come out briefly.

20:00.480 --> 20:01.400
Xiaotao?

20:02.480 --> 20:04.120
You're taking the gifts and leaving?

20:04.200 --> 20:05.040
Where's Miss Xiaoqiao?

20:07.160 --> 20:08.760
- She is asleep.
- Asleep.

20:09.920 --> 20:12.480
Since you already know, I won't keep you.

20:12.560 --> 20:14.640
Wait, why today as well?

20:16.520 --> 20:18.680
Her wounds pained her last night,

20:18.760 --> 20:21.200
so she ate a lot to ease the discomfort

20:21.280 --> 20:23.160
and she couldn't sleep till dawn.

20:23.240 --> 20:25.880
Yesterday, you said she had no appetite.
Now she's overeating?

20:27.080 --> 20:29.960
His Lordship gets to kick her out
and then summon her back.

20:30.040 --> 20:32.600
Why can't Miss Xiaoqiao eat a lot
despite having no appetite?

20:35.920 --> 20:37.440
This ailment, that ailment.

20:37.520 --> 20:38.600
I say she's just spoiled.

20:41.400 --> 20:42.240
Spoiled?

20:42.800 --> 20:44.160
My lord, did you spoil her?

20:46.000 --> 20:47.960
He means a beating would fix it.

20:48.040 --> 20:49.080
He should've said so.

20:51.200 --> 20:52.520
My lord, here you go.

20:54.400 --> 20:55.920
She's just a helpless woman

20:56.840 --> 20:59.160
driven out of Xindu by our lord,

20:59.240 --> 21:00.800
then threatened by Liu Yan,

21:00.880 --> 21:03.000
and now injured for the people's sake.

21:03.840 --> 21:06.080
It's only natural she'd feel wronged.

21:06.560 --> 21:07.800
But think about it.

21:07.880 --> 21:11.160
If our lord just apologizes properly,
won't this be resolved?

21:11.240 --> 21:12.160
It will, right?

21:12.240 --> 21:13.160
What's right?

21:13.240 --> 21:14.320
Why should I apologize?

21:14.760 --> 21:15.800
Exactly!

21:16.360 --> 21:18.200
These are just the Qiao clan's tricks.

21:23.400 --> 21:25.080
- Give me the stick.
- My lord.

21:26.200 --> 21:27.320
My lord, where are you going?

21:28.520 --> 21:30.440
I'll drag her out of that room myself.

21:30.920 --> 21:31.880
Let's go.

21:31.960 --> 21:32.840
Go.

21:34.080 --> 21:35.680
You faked illness and complained.

21:35.760 --> 21:37.960
Who knows if it'll work
on the Lord of Wei?

21:38.880 --> 21:41.760
Will playing sick make him agree to marry?

21:43.040 --> 21:44.240
He needs me.

21:52.600 --> 21:54.920
How absurd! He sent people to spy on us.

21:55.000 --> 21:56.040
My lady, hurry.

21:56.440 --> 21:57.320
Lie down, lie down.

22:00.800 --> 22:02.080
Put it away, quickly.

22:04.520 --> 22:05.720
Lie down, lie down.

22:05.800 --> 22:07.120
Close your eyes. Close them.

22:13.120 --> 22:14.400
Feeling better now, my lady?

22:16.320 --> 22:17.320
My lady.

22:17.400 --> 22:18.880
Someone just left this at the door.

22:22.400 --> 22:23.480
What is it?

22:33.800 --> 22:35.000
It's from Fan.

22:49.720 --> 22:50.720
My lord.

22:53.400 --> 22:54.600
My lady, let's go.

22:54.680 --> 22:56.000
We'll leave the back way.

22:58.320 --> 22:59.680
She really was faking it.

23:00.760 --> 23:02.680
Why are they sneaking about?

23:11.800 --> 23:12.640
Manman!

23:17.640 --> 23:18.560
Fan.

23:26.360 --> 23:28.240
I never imagined the consequence

23:28.320 --> 23:29.840
of me fleeing the marriage

23:29.920 --> 23:31.720
would be you taking my place.

23:32.480 --> 23:34.720
You just didn't want me to suffer.

23:34.800 --> 23:36.400
You didn't want me
to marry the Lord of Wei.

23:36.760 --> 23:40.840
Since you know my intentions,
why insist on coming here?

23:40.920 --> 23:43.040
Aren't you throwing my efforts away?

23:44.000 --> 23:46.280
If the Wei house is a den of wolves,

23:46.360 --> 23:48.240
I can't let you face it alone.

23:48.320 --> 23:50.240
That's why I had Bi Zhi bring me here.

23:50.320 --> 23:51.680
Let's flee together.

23:55.080 --> 23:56.000
Fan.

23:58.160 --> 24:00.360
What if I insist on marrying
the Lord of Wei?

24:01.240 --> 24:02.760
Will you let me?

24:05.240 --> 24:07.640
That Wei Shao is ruthless and cruel.

24:07.720 --> 24:09.640
He tortured Li Su mercilessly.

24:09.720 --> 24:12.000
How could he treat you any better?

24:13.280 --> 24:14.880
Look how worn you've become.

24:14.960 --> 24:17.920
That's because Liu Yan abducted me.

24:18.000 --> 24:19.440
Wei Shao had nothing to do with it.

24:20.760 --> 24:22.280
He's far better than Liu Yan.

24:24.080 --> 24:26.080
He's our clan's enemy.

24:26.920 --> 24:28.480
How could you favor him?

24:29.000 --> 24:31.320
You only know that he killed Li Su.

24:31.400 --> 24:34.200
You don't know that
he saved countless lives.

24:36.120 --> 24:37.000
And besides…

24:40.000 --> 24:40.960
Besides, he…

24:43.920 --> 24:44.840
he…

24:44.920 --> 24:46.040
he's dashing and heroic.

24:47.000 --> 24:49.160
The first time I saw him,

24:49.760 --> 24:51.480
I was already smitten.

25:00.240 --> 25:02.160
That clan's silver tongue

25:02.240 --> 25:03.840
outdoes even a strategist's tales.

25:03.920 --> 25:05.360
Since when was she "smitten"?

25:07.960 --> 25:08.960
Wait, Manman,

25:09.040 --> 25:09.760
are you…

25:09.840 --> 25:11.400
are you truly sincere?

25:11.480 --> 25:13.200
It's not just to let me be with Bi Zhi?

25:13.640 --> 25:16.000
Who said I was doing it
to let you be with Bi Zhi?

25:16.080 --> 25:17.760
If anything, I'm begging you,

25:18.240 --> 25:20.120
let me be with Wei Shao.

25:24.600 --> 25:25.880
If that's the case,

25:27.080 --> 25:30.000
then I'll harden my heart
and leave with Bi Zhi.

25:44.000 --> 25:44.880
Go.

25:55.240 --> 25:56.760
Be happy with Bi Zhi.

25:58.960 --> 26:00.040
All right?

26:02.800 --> 26:04.440
It's getting late today.

26:05.240 --> 26:06.080
Well,

26:06.320 --> 26:08.320
I'll have someone
find you a place to stay.

26:13.480 --> 26:17.000
Wasn't Qiao Yue's daughter
reported missing?

26:17.920 --> 26:20.480
Turns out she eloped with a servant.

26:20.560 --> 26:21.440
I'll go arrest her.

26:21.520 --> 26:22.560
Stop.

26:25.040 --> 26:26.480
What does he mean?

26:26.560 --> 26:28.480
Has he been charmed by
the Qiao duo's beauty,

26:29.240 --> 26:31.440
or fooled by her sweet talk?

26:35.160 --> 26:37.400
So Miss Xiaoqiao is marrying
in her cousin's stead.

26:38.640 --> 26:41.040
People of the Qiao clan
are mostly heartless.

26:41.520 --> 26:43.520
It's rare to see one like her.

26:58.000 --> 26:59.440
How are the arrangements?

26:59.520 --> 27:02.600
Don't worry, my lady. They're settled
in a secluded side chamber.

27:04.520 --> 27:05.600
Good.

27:12.000 --> 27:14.440
My lady, His Lordship is here.
He wants to see you.

27:15.600 --> 27:17.160
Were we exposed?

27:17.760 --> 27:18.840
Don't panic yet.

27:19.480 --> 27:20.920
Let's hear what he has to say.

27:35.480 --> 27:38.280
What brings you here, Lord Wei?

27:41.320 --> 27:42.400
I heard you were ill.

27:59.480 --> 28:01.200
You're suddenly

28:01.280 --> 28:03.280
so concerned about my health.

28:03.360 --> 28:06.120
Is there something to discuss?

28:08.040 --> 28:09.280
Nothing urgent.

28:09.960 --> 28:12.120
It's just that
the people of Panyi miss you

28:12.200 --> 28:13.280
and begged me to check on you.

28:15.400 --> 28:17.000
No sugarcoating today, huh?

28:17.760 --> 28:19.720
I miss them too,

28:19.800 --> 28:21.760
but my health holds me back.

28:22.440 --> 28:24.200
I caught a chill outside Xindu

28:24.280 --> 28:26.040
and my hand wound hasn't healed.

28:27.240 --> 28:30.400
I don't have the strength
to go see them now.

28:30.480 --> 28:31.880
Perhaps in a few more days.

28:39.480 --> 28:40.560
A few days ago,

28:41.040 --> 28:42.640
I drove you out of Xindu.

28:48.120 --> 28:48.960
That was my mistake.

28:50.160 --> 28:52.680
I shouldn't have imposed my grudge on you.

28:53.720 --> 28:54.760
Moreover,

28:55.200 --> 28:57.720
you fought against Liu Yan
for the people of Wei

28:57.800 --> 28:59.160
and got yourself wounded.

29:00.400 --> 29:01.560
I ought to thank you

29:01.640 --> 29:02.920
on their behalf.

29:04.240 --> 29:05.440
Lord Wei,

29:05.520 --> 29:07.160
you don't need to do this.

29:07.240 --> 29:09.600
Why apologize and thank me?

29:09.680 --> 29:11.880
I held many prejudices
against the Qiao clan,

29:12.480 --> 29:13.560
but today,

29:14.880 --> 29:16.800
I see you're different.

29:18.360 --> 29:19.640
You agreed to marry me

29:20.200 --> 29:21.400
not for yourself,

29:22.400 --> 29:23.560
but for the people…

29:25.000 --> 29:26.080
and for your cousin.

29:35.800 --> 29:37.240
Since you're unwell,

29:37.320 --> 29:39.840
avoid places like mountains.

29:40.320 --> 29:42.520
The wind is harsh.
It could worsen your condition.

29:43.480 --> 29:45.560
Even if you must meet your family,

29:46.160 --> 29:47.400
be cautious.

29:50.040 --> 29:51.680
You know I met my cousin?

30:00.080 --> 30:01.040
What will you do?

30:10.520 --> 30:12.440
I don't quarrel with women.

30:16.160 --> 30:17.760
Thank you, Lord Wei.

30:21.280 --> 30:22.360
Take your medicine.

30:31.520 --> 30:33.720
Hey, neighbors, please gather around.

30:33.800 --> 30:35.120
Come closer.

30:35.200 --> 30:36.200
Step forward.

30:36.280 --> 30:37.600
Come on, move up front!

30:37.680 --> 30:40.280
Miss Xiaoqiao has words for you all.

30:40.720 --> 30:41.880
Please, quiet down.

30:41.960 --> 30:43.040
Silence, everyone.

30:46.080 --> 30:47.400
My lady, go ahead.

30:48.480 --> 30:49.400
Neighbors,

30:50.520 --> 30:51.760
as you all know,

30:53.080 --> 30:54.520
my grandfather broke his promise

30:55.680 --> 30:57.640
to the late Lord of Wei 14 years ago,

30:58.280 --> 31:01.080
leading to the Wei family dying in battle.

31:01.560 --> 31:02.640
Xindu

31:03.520 --> 31:04.880
was then slaughtered by Li Su.

31:05.560 --> 31:08.640
The people built the People's Wall
with their loved ones' belongings

31:08.720 --> 31:10.240
to remember the hatred.

31:10.320 --> 31:11.760
Yet now, 14 years later,

31:12.560 --> 31:14.600
after the Lord of Wei retook Xindu,

31:14.680 --> 31:16.800
he ordered this wall torn down. Why?

31:16.880 --> 31:19.040
Yes, why?

31:19.120 --> 31:21.560
Because he is magnanimous

31:21.640 --> 31:23.360
and cares for the people.

31:26.480 --> 31:31.080
His Lordship retook Xindu
not just for revenge,

31:31.160 --> 31:32.960
but for a greater purpose.

31:33.040 --> 31:35.120
What purpose?

31:35.520 --> 31:38.560
My grandfather and the late Lord of Wei

31:38.640 --> 31:41.160
built the Yongning Canal together.

31:41.240 --> 31:42.640
Back then, farms flourished.

31:43.280 --> 31:45.560
But after Li Su seized Xindu,

31:45.640 --> 31:48.360
the canal silted up and was abandoned.

31:48.440 --> 31:52.000
Harvests halved and the people suffered.

31:53.200 --> 31:57.080
This time, the Lord of Wei attacked Panyi
to restore the canal.

31:57.160 --> 31:58.680
That's wonderful.

31:58.760 --> 32:00.560
- Yes.
- A true blessing!

32:01.960 --> 32:04.640
Now, with Yanzhou and Wei
united by marriage,

32:04.720 --> 32:06.760
swords will turn to plowshares.

32:07.520 --> 32:08.720
From this day on,

32:09.960 --> 32:11.280
Panyi

32:11.360 --> 32:12.880
is part of Wei.

32:13.760 --> 32:15.160
All of us

32:15.240 --> 32:16.720
are His Lordship's people.

32:16.800 --> 32:18.840
Yes, like one family! Well said!

32:18.920 --> 32:20.960
The canal is for your benefit.

32:21.480 --> 32:24.200
We ask for your full support,
people of Panyi.

32:24.280 --> 32:26.960
Good! Well said!

32:30.240 --> 32:32.240
Did you tell her about my canal project?

32:33.160 --> 32:37.160
I wouldn't dare act without orders
and ruin your plans.

32:39.040 --> 32:40.680
Then how did she know?

32:40.760 --> 32:42.000
His Lordship's actions

32:42.640 --> 32:44.400
show he values you very much.

32:45.080 --> 32:46.360
To have such a lord

32:46.440 --> 32:47.800
is Panyi's good fortune.

32:48.560 --> 32:52.680
May we stand united with the Lord of Wei
to fulfill this vision together!

32:52.760 --> 32:58.800
Stand united! Fulfill the vision!

32:58.880 --> 33:01.640
- Stand united! Fulfill the vision!
- Wei Shao crippled Liu Yan.

33:01.720 --> 33:04.720
But despite that, she's
handing over Panyi without demands.

33:04.800 --> 33:09.920
Stand united! Fulfill the vision!

33:10.000 --> 33:13.600
Stand united! Fulfill the vision!

33:34.640 --> 33:35.640
Tell me,

33:36.520 --> 33:37.720
what do you think of me?

33:39.760 --> 33:42.760
The world says
the Lord of Wei only conquers cities,

33:42.840 --> 33:47.640
but in Xindu, I studied
the Panyi Annals you gave me.

33:48.520 --> 33:51.840
I noticed the words Yongning Canal
were traced over repeatedly.

33:52.520 --> 33:55.160
Later, reviewing the map of Wei,

33:55.240 --> 33:58.360
I realized your greatest effort
these years

33:58.440 --> 33:59.640
was for building canals.

34:00.280 --> 34:01.920
Truly admirable.

34:03.720 --> 34:06.560
I'll persuade my uncle

34:06.640 --> 34:09.199
to mobilize Yanzhou's strength
in supporting you.

34:10.080 --> 34:11.960
Are you using the canals

34:12.880 --> 34:14.320
as bargaining leverage?

34:14.400 --> 34:15.840
How could I?

34:16.840 --> 34:18.000
This marriage pact

34:18.600 --> 34:20.800
isn't Wei's promise to Yanzhou.

34:21.520 --> 34:25.280
It's your vow to the people
of Wei and Yanzhou.

34:30.400 --> 34:34.760
Do you know why Bianzhou attacked Xindu
14 years ago?

34:37.560 --> 34:40.960
Because my grandfather helped Wei
build the Yongning Canal.

34:42.239 --> 34:45.040
This map is confidential.

34:45.520 --> 34:47.440
I made a copy for you.

34:47.520 --> 34:48.400
LIANGYA, PANYI, WEI STATE

34:48.480 --> 34:50.400
Don't let others see it.

34:51.560 --> 34:53.199
Once the Yongning Canal is complete,

34:53.280 --> 34:57.240
Yanzhou and Wei
will be bound like sworn allies.

34:57.840 --> 34:59.640
Bianzhou won't sit idle.

34:59.720 --> 35:02.920
They'll try to sever this lifeline.

35:03.000 --> 35:04.480
And Panyi

35:04.560 --> 35:06.920
is the vital pass along this lifeline.

35:08.120 --> 35:09.080
It's like…

35:10.240 --> 35:11.040
a heart.

35:12.960 --> 35:15.480
That day, when I handed you my seal,

35:16.240 --> 35:18.080
it wasn't because I didn't understand.

35:19.560 --> 35:21.920
It was out of remorse and sincerity

35:22.000 --> 35:24.280
that I gave you my heart.

35:29.160 --> 35:30.680
Heart? What heart?

35:32.120 --> 35:34.920
The seal's with me now.
The city's been taken.

35:35.400 --> 35:37.000
I won't give Panyi back to you.

35:37.080 --> 35:40.240
That day, when you took the seal
and drove me out of Xindu,

35:40.320 --> 35:41.760
you betrayed me alone.

35:43.400 --> 35:47.360
But now I've rallied the people of Panyi
to help you dig the canal.

35:47.440 --> 35:49.520
If you go back on your word again,

35:49.600 --> 35:50.880
the ones you'll betray

35:51.440 --> 35:53.880
are the people of Wei and Yanzhou.

35:53.960 --> 35:55.560
The people of both states.

35:57.240 --> 35:58.720
Lord Wei, how can you bear this?

36:01.560 --> 36:03.320
I can't out-argue you,

36:05.160 --> 36:06.360
but didn't you say

36:07.280 --> 36:08.440
you wouldn't marry?

36:11.920 --> 36:13.760
Lord Wei, you're magnanimous.

36:13.840 --> 36:15.240
My humble heart yearns for you.

36:18.960 --> 36:21.240
What is there to fret about?

36:21.320 --> 36:23.200
None of the Qiao clan
are capable fighters.

36:23.280 --> 36:24.560
Qiao Gui is critically ill,

36:24.640 --> 36:26.240
and Qiao Ci isn't grown yet.

36:26.320 --> 36:27.360
That leaves two.

36:27.440 --> 36:29.360
One's a coward and the other is worthless.

36:29.440 --> 36:31.360
Even with ample supplies,

36:31.440 --> 36:33.160
they've got troops but no commanders.

36:33.880 --> 36:35.760
They'd surrender Panyi,

36:35.840 --> 36:37.200
such a crucial stronghold.

36:37.280 --> 36:38.920
Clearly, they're terrified.

36:39.440 --> 36:41.080
Are they?

36:41.720 --> 36:44.280
They just fear our lord might
banish Lady Qiao again.

36:44.360 --> 36:45.640
Would that sound honorable?

36:46.440 --> 36:48.120
Since when has our lord cared about honor?

36:51.160 --> 36:52.320
Then banish her.

36:52.400 --> 36:55.640
Expel her from Panyi
like we did from Xindu last time.

36:56.240 --> 36:58.840
But who knows
if some Wang Yan or Zhang Yan

36:58.920 --> 37:01.080
will be waiting outside Panyi
to plunder her dowry?

37:08.760 --> 37:09.960
Mr. Gongsun,

37:11.120 --> 37:12.200
advise me.

37:12.880 --> 37:15.360
I dare not bring shame upon you.

37:15.920 --> 37:18.800
Please make your own decision.

37:24.880 --> 37:27.800
Who knows when we'll meet again
after you leave this time?

37:28.440 --> 37:31.800
Find a place to settle down quickly
so we can still exchange letters.

37:33.440 --> 37:35.920
Once I find a place to call home,
I'll surely let you know.

37:37.120 --> 37:38.000
Good.

37:40.120 --> 37:41.880
You've never suffered like this before.

37:42.440 --> 37:46.920
If you must blame someone,

37:47.000 --> 37:49.200
blame our clan's lack of warriors.

37:51.720 --> 37:52.680
Whoa.

37:58.560 --> 37:59.720
Fan, my lady,

37:59.800 --> 38:01.240
a boulder blocks the path ahead.

38:01.320 --> 38:02.320
Rest a while.

38:02.400 --> 38:03.400
I'll move it aside.

38:05.120 --> 38:05.880
Let's go.

38:27.040 --> 38:29.880
We heard you were exiled from Xindu
by the Lord of Wei,

38:30.360 --> 38:32.000
so we came after you.

38:32.080 --> 38:36.400
On the way, we encountered
Wei troops and fought them.

38:37.400 --> 38:38.440
Later, in Panyi,

38:39.280 --> 38:41.240
I clashed with Liu Yan's forces too.

38:42.120 --> 38:44.080
A three-way battle.

38:44.160 --> 38:47.080
You moved through them
like they weren't even there.

38:53.080 --> 38:55.240
He does possess some brute strength.

38:57.280 --> 38:58.520
We're tired from the journey.

38:58.600 --> 39:00.520
Bi Zhi, please go find us some food.

39:01.160 --> 39:02.200
That's easy enough.

39:04.120 --> 39:06.880
Fan, I have something important
to tell you.

39:07.320 --> 39:10.760
This concerns Yanzhou's survival.
You must do your best with this.

39:12.680 --> 39:16.200
At the border where Yanzhou,
Wei, and Bianzhou meet,

39:16.280 --> 39:18.600
there's a county called Boya.

39:18.960 --> 39:21.600
To sue for peace,
Yanzhou gave up its heart.

39:21.680 --> 39:25.040
Now that Panyi is in Wei Shao's hands,
we've lost the advantage.

39:25.120 --> 39:28.600
We must secure a backup plan
and hold this strategic location.

39:29.360 --> 39:31.160
Our repeated retreats happened

39:31.240 --> 39:34.080
because we had troops but no leaders
or capable fighters.

39:34.160 --> 39:35.800
With Bi Zhi here,

39:35.880 --> 39:37.680
I believe we can hold it.

39:41.640 --> 39:43.200
Manman says we should go to Boya.

39:43.600 --> 39:44.840
Then we go to Boya.

39:44.920 --> 39:46.320
What kind of place is it?

39:46.400 --> 39:47.760
A county.

39:49.200 --> 39:51.720
It's a good land,
near mountains with mines.

39:52.760 --> 39:53.640
It's also bad.

39:54.480 --> 39:56.000
Everyone wants to take it,

39:56.080 --> 39:58.080
but none dare make the first move.

39:58.560 --> 40:01.080
I don't expect glory from you,

40:01.160 --> 40:03.320
just your safety.

40:04.360 --> 40:05.280
Bi Zhi,

40:05.800 --> 40:09.240
let's just be
a happy ordinary couple, all right?

40:09.880 --> 40:10.760
All right.

40:25.360 --> 40:27.160
You parted with your cousin,

40:27.240 --> 40:28.920
yet you seem unshaken.

40:30.040 --> 40:33.400
My lady has fulfilled a wish,
so she's delighted.

40:33.760 --> 40:34.880
What wish?

40:35.840 --> 40:38.160
Our Qiao clan finally has a true warrior.

40:38.240 --> 40:40.560
That Bi Zhi
was born with godlike strength.

40:42.640 --> 40:44.000
What a fine match!

40:44.360 --> 40:46.520
But what of my lady's marriage?

40:48.000 --> 40:49.360
A full day has passed.

40:49.440 --> 40:51.400
Why is there no word from His Lordship?

40:51.480 --> 40:52.840
These things take time.

40:52.920 --> 40:54.280
Haste makes waste.

40:56.600 --> 40:57.480
My lady.

41:01.680 --> 41:02.480
My lady,

41:02.560 --> 41:04.520
you were missing for a whole day.

41:04.600 --> 41:05.960
It turns out you're here for tea?

41:08.200 --> 41:10.120
You already gave away a city.

41:10.200 --> 41:11.880
Now you're promising to build canals?

41:12.480 --> 41:14.320
Patience. Sit.

41:14.400 --> 41:15.360
I…

41:19.760 --> 41:21.680
We seek an alliance with Wei.

41:21.760 --> 41:23.280
Shouldn't we show sincerity?

41:24.520 --> 41:26.200
And let them keep nibbling at us?

41:27.320 --> 41:29.960
These canals will solve Wei's drought.

41:30.040 --> 41:32.080
Won't that make the Lord of Wei
unstoppable?

41:32.160 --> 41:33.600
You're right.

41:34.440 --> 41:36.120
If this succeeds,

41:36.200 --> 41:38.200
Wei will grow even stronger.

41:38.280 --> 41:40.160
The threat Yanzhou faces will be greater.

41:40.840 --> 41:43.440
But these are long-term pros and cons.

41:44.160 --> 41:45.840
For now,

41:45.920 --> 41:47.520
if this succeeds,

41:47.600 --> 41:49.200
the benefits outweigh the risks.

41:51.520 --> 41:53.680
And where do these benefits come from?

41:54.320 --> 41:56.160
Wei Shao's canal project is inevitable.

41:56.240 --> 41:58.520
Even if I refuse, he'll conduct it anyway.

41:58.600 --> 42:00.680
But while building the canal,

42:00.760 --> 42:02.720
he'll deploy considerable troops,

42:02.800 --> 42:05.480
leaving no resources to attack Yanzhou.

42:06.240 --> 42:07.760
This gives us

42:07.840 --> 42:10.160
a breathing space.

42:10.840 --> 42:14.600
I'll use this marriage to turn the tide.

42:16.120 --> 42:19.040
But now it seems that this marriage

42:19.120 --> 42:20.720
may not happen after all.

42:21.560 --> 42:22.920
What do you mean?

42:25.400 --> 42:26.440
Lord Qiao Gui…

42:27.400 --> 42:28.240
has passed away.

42:30.600 --> 42:33.040
I came specifically to deliver this news.

42:37.120 --> 42:37.960
Wait.

42:39.400 --> 42:41.760
This is no joking matter.

43:17.080 --> 43:19.880
QIAO GUI, GOVERNOR OF YANZHOU…

43:25.120 --> 43:28.080
PASSED AWAY PEACEFULLY
ON APRIL 13TH, AGED 60.

43:35.000 --> 43:36.680
When did this happen?

43:37.480 --> 43:38.680
Today,

43:38.760 --> 43:41.360
it happens to be his fifth-week memorial.

43:41.440 --> 43:44.600
QIAO GUI, GOVERNOR OF YANZHOU

44:04.960 --> 44:06.040
My lady,

44:06.760 --> 44:09.240
building canals is no small matter.

44:10.560 --> 44:13.240
You can't just act on impulse alone.

44:28.160 --> 44:30.360
QIAO GUI, GOVERNOR OF YANZHOU

44:41.080 --> 44:42.600
My lady, are you all right?

44:44.680 --> 44:46.600
PASSED AWAY PEACEFULLY
ON APRIL 13TH, AGED 60.

44:47.960 --> 44:50.880
I missed my chance
to see him one last time.
